{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If an object is nearby, grab it and process it, else approach it. Move if necessary. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    />  <Action ID = ApproachObject    />  <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />  <Action ID = ProcessObject    />  <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    />  <SubTree ID = MoveToDesiredLocation    />  <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    />\"",
